== builtin unknown flag carries the Builtin prefix:
1:8: error: Builtin `enable`: Unknown flag '--badflag'.
     1 |  enable --badflag
       |         ^~~~~~~~~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
== koshkit unknown flag carries the koshkit util prefix:
1:12: error: koshkit ls: Unknown flag '--dasdas'.
     1 |  koshkit ls --dasdas
       |             ^~~~~~~~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
== multibyte unknown flag in a koshkit utility keeps the whole character:
1:17: error: koshkit eviliso: Unknown flag '-в'.
     1 |  koshkit eviliso -в
       |                  ^~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
== multibyte unknown flag after an ASCII flag keeps the whole character:
1:12: error: koshkit ls: Unknown flag '-в'.
     1 |  koshkit ls -aв
       |             ^~~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
== multibyte unknown flag in a builtin keeps the whole character:
1:6: error: Builtin `type`: Unknown flag '-в'.
     1 |  type -в
       |       ^~
note: Use `--` before an operand that begins with a dash.
== multibyte unknown option in set keeps the whole character:
1:5: error: Builtin `set`: Unknown option '-в'.
     1 |  set -aв
       |      ^~~
== multibyte unknown flag of the shell keeps the whole character:
error: Unknown flag '-в'.
== multibyte invalid option in exec and eval keeps the whole character:
1:6: error: Builtin `exec`: Invalid option -- в.
     1 |  exec -в
       |       ^~
note: Run 'exec --help' for the accepted options.
1:6: error: Builtin `eval`: -в: invalid option.
     1 |  eval -в
       |       ^~
note: Try `eval --help` for more info.
